00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:18,000
An American Carol is a comedy, fantasy film directed by David Zucker.

3
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:24,000
A cynical anti-American Hollywood filmmaker sets out on a
crusade to abolish the 4th of July holiday.

4
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:30,000
He is visited by three spirits who take him on a hilarious journey in
an attempt to show him the true meaning of America.

5
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Michael Malone, played by Kevin Farley.

6
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:42,000
General George S. Patton, played by Kelsey Grammer.

7
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:48,000
Osama Bin Nielsen / Grandpa, played by Leslie Nielsen.

8
